{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 17:32:44.968397", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Health Overview\\nThe enterprise hierarchical network appears to be experiencing significant connectivity issues. Based on the initial tests, hosts are unable to reach critical infrastructure components, including the load balancer, DNS server, and DHCP server. This indicates a widespread anomaly affecting end-to-end communication.\\n\\n#### Findings\\n1. **Host Connectivity Issues**:\\n   - Both `host_1_1_1_1` and `host_2_1_1_1` failed to establish connectivity with the following key network components:\\n     - Load Balancer (`load_balancer`)\\n     - DNS Server (`dns_server`)\\n     - DHCP Server (`dhcp_server`)\\n   - The error message \"Network is unreachable\" suggests that the hosts are unable to route packets to these destinations.\\n\\n2. **Potential Scope of the Problem**:\\n   - The issue is not isolated to a single host or destination. Both hosts are affected, and all tested destinations are unreachable.\\n   - This points to a systemic problem, potentially at the distribution or core layer of the network.\\n\\n3. **Impact on Services**:\\n   - Hosts cannot resolve DNS queries, obtain IP configurations via DHCP, or access web services through the load balancer. This would render the network unusable for end-users.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of the anomaly. Key areas to focus on include:\\n- OSPF routing configurations and advertisements across the routers.\\n- Network configurations and operational status of the distribution and core routers.\\n- Connectivity and operational status of the access switches.\\n\\nThis report highlights the critical connectivity issues observed in the network., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='17037109-47ed-4cce-8075-3296d96fb48d'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
